# Maven (T-P5-MAVEN): mvn 3.9 (client-maven) and Maven 4, Gradle 8, Gradle 9 and sbt (client-jvm) resolve through a
# Maven Central proxy and a group, and deploy releases and SNAPSHOTs to hosted repositories (test.sh).
# tests/clients/README.md; Documents/Operations/clients/maven.md.
#
# The client images carry what the tools need to build (Maven 3.9 and 4 plugins, sbt itself) pre-seeded from Maven
# Central at image build time, so the fixtures hold only what the tests resolve through Waystation: hamcrest-library
# 1.3 with hamcrest-core (and their parent POM) and reactive-streams through a version range (maven-metadata.xml),
# < 1 MiB.

# Upstream host names the fake upstream impersonates.
HOSTS="repo.maven.apache.org"
CLIENT="maven jvm"
NEEDS_STACK=1
FIXTURE_BUDGET_KB=1024
